  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1203.49 Multicategory stationary VOC source",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.49 \"Multicategory stationary VOC source\" means any stationary source of VOCs which, excluding non-core activities as enumerated in Env-A 1203.53, has either:\n\n(a) At least 2 classifiable processes or devices in dissimiliar VOC categories; or\n\n(b) At least one classifiable process or device and at least one unclassifiable process or device.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1200.html"
}
